ub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Allow array access to array-based callables.\r\n\r\n```php\r\nfunction resolveParameters(callable $callback)\r\n{\r\n\t// [<object>, <string>] array style callable.\r\n\tif( is_array($callback) ) {\r\n\t\t$parameters = (new \\ReflectionClass(get_class($callback[0])))->getMethod($callback[1])->getParameters();\r\n\t}\r\n\r\n\t// All other callables\r\n\telse {\r\n\t\t$parameters = (new \\ReflectionFunction($callback))->getParameters();\r\n\t}\r\n\r\n        return $parameters;\r\n}\r\n\r\nclass Speaker\r\n{\r\n  public function sayHello(): string\r\n  {\r\n        echo \"Hello!\";\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n\r\n$speaker = new Speaker;\r\n$parameters = resolveParameters([$speaker, \"sayHello\"]);\r\n```\r\n\r\nResults in:\r\n\r\n```bash\r\nERROR: InvalidArrayAccess - Cannot access array value on non-array variable $callback of type callable\r\n            $functionParameters = (new \\ReflectionClass(get_class($callback[0])))->getMethod($callback[1])->getParameters();\r\n\r\n\r\nERROR: InvalidArrayAccess - Cannot access array value on non-array variable $callback of type callable\r\n            $functionParameters = (new \\ReflectionClass(get_class($callback[0])))->getMethod($callback[1])->getParameters();\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"muglug","id":2292638,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyOTI2Mzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2292638?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug","html_url":"https://github.com/muglug","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/subscript